  "how": "Made by hand, after the campaign, from the Linux host's window log, its backup job's log and this project's session records, with each time in UTC. The host does not record logins: its login record was last written before the campaign began, so each login's time is the session records', known to the minute. A query phase with no query named is the whole phase of that kind for the variant, since the documents keep no time per query.",
